    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/c4c7599462f44efcd1ba2ff5b4cc7c01.avif?t=1754617975\" data-has-big width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AFTER ARRIVING AT RAVENHILLE, A TRUE CHALLENGE AWAITS YOU. DELVE INTO THE CURSED FOREST AND KILL THE ANCIENT BEAST THAT CAME FROM HELL - BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and hunt down the beast.</strong> It hides in the darkness, watching your every move. This creature wasn\u2019t born, it was made, then left to rot in the forest. A single bullet won\u2019t stop it. If you miss, you may not get a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i> the forgotten village and the cursed forest that <strong><i>hides the darkest secrets</i></strong>. No matter how peaceful it seems, nothing truly is. Use your <strong><i>Karabiner 98k</i></strong> and your sword to protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot <strong><i>forgotten relics</i></strong>, <i><strong>keys</strong></i>, <i><strong>skill books</strong></i>, ammo, and money. Every item holds a story or a secret. Use your coins in the shop to buy useful tools, upgrades, and strange curiosities. Saving up for something valuable might be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wander through strange places, caves</strong></i>\u00a0and cursed structures. But one thing matters most: stay alert. The creatures that dwell here have learned to hide well in the dark.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/c4c7599462f44efcd1ba2ff5b4cc7c01.avif?t=1754617975\" data-has-big width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AFTER ARRIVING AT RAVENHILLE, A TRUE CHALLENGE AWAITS YOU. DELVE INTO THE CURSED FOREST AND KILL THE ANCIENT BEAST THAT CAME FROM HELL - BEFORE IT\u2019S TOO LATE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/26a01502b2d5b62d356fbfb8dc10fb93.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and hunt down the beast.</strong> It hides in the darkness, watching your every move. This creature wasn\u2019t born, it was made, then left to rot in the forest. A single bullet won\u2019t stop it. If you miss, you may not get a second chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/00f43d63fb5d63b78e3f3bd9dbbe24bb.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore</strong></i> the forgotten village and the cursed forest that <strong><i>hides the darkest secrets</i></strong>. No matter how peaceful it seems, nothing truly is. Use your <strong><i>Karabiner 98k</i></strong> and your sword to protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/1a53713f097102a9e66f6b0794043306.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot <strong><i>forgotten relics</i></strong>, <i><strong>keys</strong></i>, <i><strong>skill books</strong></i>, ammo, and money. Every item holds a story or a secret. Use your coins in the shop to buy useful tools, upgrades, and strange curiosities. Saving up for something valuable might be worth it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.poster.avif?t=1754617975\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.webm?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678080/extras/b9fc4718ae958bd3ab1d4c040c8833e5.mp4?t=1754617975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Wander through strange places, caves</strong></i>\u00a0and cursed structures. But one thing matters most: stay alert. The creatures that dwell here have learned to hide well in the dark.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hunt down the mythical beast, created in desperation during the final days of World War II. A failed Nazi project known as \u201cWolfsklinge\u201d unleashed an ancient creature from the depths of hell. Now, it\u2019s your task to lift the curse that haunts the village and the forest. It won\u2019t be easy.",
